    "chunk_text": "e sylfwilles Se H\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea him to, Se d\u00e6g h\u00e6f\u00f0 twelf tida, and se \u00f0e f\u00e6r\u00f0 on d\u00e6g, hys fot ne \u00e6tspyrn\u00f0, for He is se so\u00f0a d\u00e6g, and \u00fe\u00e6t so\u00f0e leoht ealles middaneardes, and se man \u00fee him filig\u00f0, ne g\u00e6\u00f0 he na on His twelf apostoli synt \u00fea twelf tida \u00fee \u00f0am d\u00e6ge folgia\u00f0 Drihtne H\u00e6lende, \u00feeah \u00fee se swicola Iudas, Se H\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Marthan, Lazares swuster, Ic eom \u00e6rist and lif; se \u00f0e gelyf\u00f0 on me, \u00feeah \u00fee he And he s\u00e6de on o\u00f0re stowe, Ego sum Deus Abraham et Deus Isaac et Deus Iacob: Ic eom Abrahames Nis na God deadra manna, ac is libbendra; ealle menn him lybba\u00f0. Se \u00fee on hine gelyf\u00f0, \u00feeah \u00fee he dead si, he sceal libban swa\u00feeah, and se \u00f0e ne gelyf\u00f0 on hyne, \u00feeah We ne durran gelencgan na leng \u00feysne traht, ne eow geswencan na swi\u00f0or mid \u00feam, \u00fee l\u00e6s \u00fee eower.",
